The artist must receive a minimum number of valid views on eligible free videos.

3. Watch hours (Required)

The artist must accumulate the required watch hours across eligible free videos on their account.

4. Account verification (Required)

Artist identity, account status and payment information must be verified.

5. Content policy (Required)

The account must follow PayTune's copyright, community and advertising policies.

2. How artists qualify
The system should calculate these metrics automatically:

Requirement	What PayTune measures
Followers	Total genuine followers
Views	Valid views on eligible free videos
Watch hours	Valid viewing time across eligible free videos
